    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"letting go of the expectation\"... i don't know. it feels almost like you're saying there's a certain kind of peace in just surrendering to it. like, if the nothingness is inevitable, then maybe fighting it is just pointless suffering. there's this thought that i keep having... that if i just stopped everything, the noise and the emptiness would finally just stop together. like a final, quiet resolution. does that sound crazy to you?",
